Package: modularDAC
Title: Quickly learn large networks by dividing data into modules
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Luke", "Berger", , "lukeberg@bu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0006-9987-3304"))
Description: Provies functions to divide datasets into overlapping modules, learn networks within those modules, then connect those networks into one graph.
